1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,990
Petrol ka price hamesha paise mein kyun hota hai?

2
00:00:03,010 --> 00:00:05,560
Kabhi ₹100 ya ₹102 jaisa round amount kyun nahi?

3
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:08,090
Delhi mein aaj ₹102.12. Chalo, isko todte hain.

4
00:00:08,110 --> 00:00:10,220
Tel company ka hissa: lagbhag ₹61.80.

5
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:12,030
Centre sarkar ka tax: ₹19.90.

6
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:14,000
Pump wale bhaiya ki kamai: ₹3.83.

7
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:15,600
Itna samajh gaye?

8
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:18,610
Ab state ka tax. Yahi hissa price ko round nahi rehne deta.

9
00:00:18,630 --> 00:00:21,460
Yeh percent mein lagta hai, lagbhag 19%, matlab ₹16.59.

10
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:23,630
Ab sirf paise jodo: 80, 90, 83 aur 59.

11
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:25,840
Total 312 paise, yaani ₹3 aur 12 paise.

12
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:28,890
Isliye petrol hamesha paise mein hota hai, kabhi round nahi.

13
00:00:28,910 --> 00:00:31,220
Aapke shehar mein aaj petrol kitne ka hai?

14
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:33,750
